     center` overrides it. The property is UNPREFIXED-only: no engine ever
     shipped `-webkit-ruby-align` (it silently parse-fails), and WebKit added
     unprefixed ruby-align in Safari 18.2 — so this reaches the reported iPad
     (>=18.2) but is inert on older WebKit, where there is no ruby-align at all.
