     whole-word reading. A genuinely merged reading with no per-position evidence
     (jukujikun 昨日/きのう, or a server that only sends 技術[ぎじゅつ]) keeps the
     whole-run rt and relies on ruby-align alone — never a guessed split. The
     critical inline subset carries these ruby rules too so they still reach ruby
     rendered before the full sheet loads and inside shadow roots (see
     CRITICAL_READER_CSS in styles/index.ts). */
