  display: ruby-text !important;
}

/* Compact controls and clipped rows cannot accept native ruby line metrics,
   but hiding rt also hides the very reading the user enabled. Detached
   readings keep the base wrapper at the page's original line height and paint
   the kana in an out-of-flow lane. The wrapper width is BASE-only, so a long
   reading never opens gaps or narrows a flex/grid title column. */

